Package: neuronte
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: neural font library
 Neuronte draws characters from a packed weight file the caller supplies.
 This package installs the shared library and a load probe. Packed weight
 files stay outside the package.
